+38: - project list uses backend `/project`: implemented by `sdk.client.project.list()` in `DialogProjectList`; generated SDK maps this to `/project`.
+39: - project list searches display name and directory: implemented by `projectSearchText()` and covered by `dialog-project-list.test.ts`.
+40: - project list shows display name and directory: implemented by `createProjectListOptions()` title/details and covered by `dialog-project-list.test.ts`.
+41: - project list has no deletion action: implemented; `DialogProjectList` only exposes the open-project action and no delete action.
+42: - `ctrl+o` opens add-project from project list: implemented via `dialog.project.open` action and default keybind in `packages/tui/src/config/keybind.ts`.
+43: - add-project has no direct command: implemented; `DialogProjectAdd` is only created from the project list command flow in `app.tsx`.
+44: - `esc` from add-project returns project list: implemented by `DialogProjectAdd` calling `props.onBack()` on escape.
+45: - add-project starts at current project parent directory: implemented by `projectParentDirectory()` and covered by `dialog-project-add.test.ts`.
+46: - selector lists direct child directories: implemented by server `directory.list` returning only entries with `entry.type === "directory"`; covered by `httpapi-directory.test.ts`.
+47: - search debounce is `10ms`: implemented by `setTimeout(..., 10)` in `DialogProjectAdd`.
+48: - space copies selected directory into input and loads children: implemented by `chooseSelected()` calling `load(item.absolute)` on space.
+49: - enter confirms input value: implemented by `confirm()` calling `switchProject(normalizeProjectInput(input()))`; it does not read the selected item.
